{start_of_verse: Verse}
[Am]Mitti ki khushboo, pehl[G]i baarish ki
[F]Yaad dilaaye mujhe ghar [E]ki
[Am]Amma ki roti, Abba k[G]i daant
[F]Woh aangan, woh neem ki [E]chhaanv
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]Laut chalein, [G]laut chalein
[Am]Apne gaon ki gali[E]yon mein
[F]Laut chalein, [G]laut chalein
[Am]Bachpan ki un [E]kaliyon me[Am]in
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse}
[Am]Shehar ki bheed mein kh[G]o gaya hoon
[F]Jaagte jaagte so gaya [E]hoon
[Am]Phone pe Amma poochhe [G]har din
[F]Kab aayega beta, kis di[E]n
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[F]Laut chalein, [G]laut chalein
[Am]Apne gaon ki gali[E]yon mein
[F]Laut chalein, [G]laut chalein
